# Assigned sites + real induction — 1.0.2+25

- Operative **Select site** and **My Inductions** use `GET /api/me/assigned-sites`.
- Superuser / Super Admin / Supervisor add people on Sites → Induction (no RAMS-before-assign).
- Induction opens safety pack, RAMS (sign or already signed), then site rules.
- Company default: Health & Safety → Induction safety. Per-site copy: Sites → Safety info.

Do not bump the marketing version past 1.0.2 unless Steven asks.
